> Using Us_tax_code as T

```catala
declaration scope Data:
  output price content money
  output periods content list of T.Period

scope Data:
  definition price equals $1,500.50
  definition periods equals [ period_one; ]
  definition period_one equals T.Period { -- begin: |2019-01-01| -- end: |2020-01-01| }
```

```catala-metadata
#[test]
declaration scope Test1:
  section scope T.QualifiedEmployeeDiscount
  data_ scope Data

scope Test1:
  # A comment, then statements over several lines
  definition
    section.customer_price
  equals
    data_.price
  definition section.discount_type equals T.DiscountType.Services
  definition section.return_type equals T.ReturnType.SingleReturn content data_.periods
  assertion section.gross_profit_percentage = 0.4
  assertion not section.is_property
  assertion section.is_services
```
